WEBVTT

NOTE
The Esthar sealing apparatus — containment chamber and the sealing monolith.
Duration: approximately 41 seconds.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.780
Rows of glowing pink containment cubes fill a vast Esthar chamber.

00:00:05.070 --> 00:00:08.550
They stretch toward seated figures at the rim.

00:00:21.730 --> 00:00:26.930
The tall Esthar sealing monolith lowers onto a barren plain at sunset.
